# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# plan_entity.md step 8e-sound's own subjects.
#
# TWO INFO_PLAYER_DEATHMATCH ORIGINS, read out of dm_lockdown's entity lump
# rather than remembered, and chosen for two properties at once:
#
#   * each sits within a handful of units of an env_soundscape whose radius is
